Package: demoreel
Version: @VERSION@-1
Architecture: all
Maintainer: Anthony Schemel <milnet01@users.noreply.github.com>
Section: video
Priority: optional
Homepage: https://github.com/milnet01/demoreel
Depends: python3, xvfb, xauth, xdotool, ffmpeg, fontconfig, fonts-dejavu-core
Recommends: cage, xwayland, wlr-randr, wf-recorder
Description: record a GUI app on a private virtual display
 demoreel records a video or a picture of one app running on a display of
 its own, so nothing of your desktop can end up in frame. It can also trim,
 caption and join recordings, and make a short film from them.
 .
 The recommended packages are for --gpu, which records apps that need the
 graphics card.
